## Brand Colour

If you need Centrapay colours in your design, use the Centrapay brand orange.

| Format | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Hex | `#FF5C00` |
| RGB | `255 92 0` |
| HSL | `22° 100% 50%` |
| HSB | `22° 100% 100%` |
